        "content": [
          {
            "text": "\u003csystem-reminder\u003e\nWorkspace notes were loaded automatically from /workspace/tasky/NOTES.md. Treat them as background, not as a request.\n\n- Go 1.24, standard library only.\n- Tests sit next to the code they cover.\n\u003c/system-reminder\u003e",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "\u003csystem-reminder\u003e\nHelper roles you can start with spawn_helper:\n- reviewer: reads a diff and lists likely bugs, read-only.\n- tester: writes table-driven tests for one function.\n- scout: searches the repository and answers a narrow question.\n- writer: drafts user-facing text such as README sections or help output.\nEach helper starts with an empty context and returns one report. Give it the file paths it needs, the exact question, and the form you want the answer in. Helpers cannot ask follow-up questions.\n\u003c/system-reminder\u003e",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "Summarize what this repository does in two sentences, then suggest one small improvement.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "role": "user"
      },
